OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIsolated
OL,6,Fshowers during the evening, focused
OL,7,Fover Argyll, otherwise mainly dry with
OL,8,Fclear spells and light winds bringing
OL,9,Fa frosty start to the week for many.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FCold. Frosty start for many.
OL,12,FSunny spells. Most dry but showers in
OL,13,Ffar north during the morning. Higher
OL,14,Fcloud feeding from south for afternoon.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,17,FTuesday brings periods of rain and
OL,18,Fhill snow, which turns heavy at times.
OL,19,FWednesday rather cloudy with some
OL,20,Fpatchy rain.Thursday frosty, dry and
OL,21,Fbright.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
